  "title": "Grand Design’s Foundation: Designed for the destination",
  "summary": "Grand Design’s new Foundation destination trailer arrives with a clear purpose: to give campers a place that feels just like home. As more RVers find permanent or semi-permanent sites they love, the demand for destination trailers has grown. The Foundation meets that need, rounding out Grand Design’s full product portfolio so customers can stay with a brand they trust at every stage of their adventure.",
